    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the land described below to create a water tank in the upper area of Bellanwila Divulpitiya area under Weras Ganga Storm Water Drainage & Environment Improvement Project.",
